      "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request addresses a JSON serialization error in Qwen3.5 and Qwen3.5-MoE configurations by changing the `ignore_keys_at_rope_validation` field from a set to a list. This ensures compatibility with `huggingface_hub` >= 1.7.2, which requires configurations to be JSON serializable for validation. New test cases have been added to `tests/transformers_utils/test_config.py` to prevent future regressions. I have no feedback to provide.",
